abi/engine.json, abi/layouts.json and crates/abi/src/generated/ are derived from Facepunch Studios'
s&box engine source (github.com/Facepunch/sbox-public): the interop definitions in
engine/Definitions, the InteropGen generator in engine/Tools/InteropGen (compiled from source by
tools/interop-dump), and struct layouts read from the managed engine built from that source. The
slot names, class names, struct names and table order are Facepunch's.

